   "id": "examples-imports-md-5",
   "kind": {
    "type": "markdown"
   },
   "source": "## `use @lang`\n\n`use @lang <language> \"<module>\" [as <alias>]` writes the import into every later\nblock of that language, under the module's own name and the alias:\n",
   "state": {
    "status": "done"
   },
   "meta": {},
   "outputs": []
  },
  {
